# Release Notes — v3.2.0

## New Features

- Added dark mode support across all pages
- Introduced real-time collaboration via WebSocket
- New CSV export for analytics dashboard

## Bug Fixes

- Fixed memory leak in long-running background tasks
- Corrected timezone handling for scheduled reports
- Resolved intermittent 503 errors during deployments

## Breaking Changes

- Removed deprecated `/api/v1/legacy` endpoints
- Minimum Node.js version is now 18.x

## Migration Guide

Update your configuration file:

```yaml
server:
  min_node_version: "18.0.0"
  websocket:
    enabled: true
```
